{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "daf7a41a-e23d-8fa6-a2ec-c2e94885c127",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T18:04:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luis Cabral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:02:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:02:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I know it's after hours, City Hall's closed, but the recording said this line was open for storm stuff. [line breaks up] Can you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:02:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you, a little choppy. Go ahead, I've got you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:02:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It's Luis Cabral, 270 Admiral Kalbfus Road, up the North End. After that snow-to-rain storm, Sunday into Monday, the whole street flooded again. The water just sits at the drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:02:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "270 Admiral Kalbfus Road, the street flooded after the storm Sunday into Monday. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:03:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, as I said, the street. Last winter it flooded twice. This winter it's once so far. So I want to know if anything is planned for it. Anything at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:03:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so twice last winter, once so far this winter. Is the water getting into the house, or is it the roadway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:03:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The road. [sighs] But my neighbor next door, she's older, she can't get out when it's like that. [inaudible] She's stuck till it drains."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:03:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up. She can't get out of her house when the water's up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:03:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, she can't get out. Hold on, my niece is here, she wants me to read her homework out loud first. [pause] Okay, sorry. Not now, honey. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:03:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. I'll put in a request for the crew to look at the drain on Admiral Kalbfus and note the neighbor situation."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:03:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And do the crews work on weekends? Because it's always the weekend it happens."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:03:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do get called out for storms, yes. I can't tell you what's scheduled for your street, though. I'll flag it and have someone call you back at 401-555-0174, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:04:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's it. I hope somebody actually calls."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:04:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got it noted. Thanks for calling, Mr. Cabral."
    }
  ],
